| Env vars | `DB_PATH`, `LOG_FILE`, `DB_HOST`, `DB_PORT`, `DB_USER`, `DB_PASS` via `os.environ.get` with defaults |
| SQL injection fix | `cur.execute("INSERT ... VALUES (?, ?, ?)", (str(ts), msg, count))` — parameterized throughout |
| ETL functions | `extract_log_entries` (Extract) → `transform_entries` (Transform) → `load_to_db` + `generate_html_report` (Load) |
| Regex parsing | Four compiled `re.compile` patterns (`_RE_ERROR`, `_RE_USER`, `_RE_API`, `_RE_WARN`) with named capture groups |
| Type hints + docstrings | `NamedTuple` types for all domain objects, full signatures on every function, docstrings on module/class/function |
